<!-- r46 (the APK-matrix round): the full-engine flavor's launcher
     label (applicationIdSuffix .engine, installs separately like the
     edit app). Flavor res overrides the main source set's same-named
     resource (the main value stays the fallback for the basic build).
     r47 shipped the canonical "toadGALLERY" here per a maintainer
     directive; r50 (the UI/UX polish round) supersedes it back to the
     r46 suffixed shape: basic and engine are INSTALLED SIDE BY SIDE on
     the maintainer's dogfood devices, and two launcher entries with
     the SAME name and the SAME shared icon are indistinguishable (the
     r50 dual-flavor audit finding; semantic/face keep their suffixed
     labels, so the engine build rejoining them is also the consistent
     four-flavor matrix). The .engine applicationIdSuffix still keeps
     it a separate install; the distinct label just makes the two
     coexisting installs tellable apart on the launcher. -->
<resources>
    <string name="app_launcher_name">toadGALLERY Engine</string>
</resources>
